110 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (PageMD is an AI-powered medical paging system that eliminates the phone-intake bottleneck in outpatient clinics by intelligently handling and routing incoming calls, allowing clinical staff, especially nurses, to spend more time on direct patient care instead of administrative communication tasks. By modernizing how clinics manage inbound communication, PageMD improves workflow efficiency, reduces response delays, and enables practices to scale patient access without increasing staffing burden.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
