116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (PageMD targets outpatient clinics and private practices where communication inefficiencies are most pronounced. In Evansville alone, approximately 62 clinics would benefit from improved call management, with an estimated 34% independently owned and operated, making them ideal early adopters due to faster decision-making. By focusing on independent practices, PageMD can establish pilots, validate impact, and build a foundation for regional expansion.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [10]
>>
