125 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (The PageMD workflow replaces traditional operator-based paging by instantly answering and processing inbound calls through a conversational AI system that interacts naturally with callers in real time. It identifies the caller, determines the urgency and purpose of the request, and delivers a structured, prioritized message directly to the appropriate provider. Because PageMD can handle multiple incoming calls simultaneously, it removes the operator bottleneck that often forces nurses and staff to wait on hold before relaying information. This eliminates hold times and ensures faster, more efficient clinical communication without disrupting existing workflows, allowing providers and nurses to spend more time focused on patient care rather than administrative coordination.)
