/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (PageMD is designed to be a capital-efficient solution with a clear path to early validation and scalable adoption in independent clinical settings. An initial $1,000 investment will be strategically allocated to support three key priorities: 40% toward continued development of the conversational call-handling system, 40% toward pilot deployment with local partner clinics, and 20% toward targeted outreach to independent practices in the Evansville area. These funds will enable PageMD to refine its workflow integration, validate performance in real clinical environments, and strengthen early provider relationships. By focusing resources on technical improvement and pilot readiness, this investment will directly support measurable validation milestones and position PageMD for broader regional adoption.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
